-----BEGIN PLACEHOLDER-PRIVATE-KEY-----
This file previously contained a live RSA private key that was committed
to source control (Semgrep: generic.secrets.security.detected-private-key).
The key material has been removed and the exposed key MUST be treated as
compromised and rotated/reissued.

Do NOT commit real private key material to this repository. Generate a
local development certificate/key pair out-of-band (e.g. via `openssl` or
your platform's cert tooling) and load it from a path/secret provided via
environment configuration, or use a secrets manager. This placeholder file
exists only so that any code path referencing
"artifacts/cert/server.key" (currently unused/commented out in server.js)
does not fail on a missing file.
-----END PLACEHOLDER-PRIVATE-KEY-----
